    {
      "id": 140049,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-16T17:16:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is it one that is announced already? &nbsp;That's what I expect it to be.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Likey it is one of the new characters to Tactics if they plan on spending time going through the concept and all of that. They wouldn't need to touch too much on the concept of a character we already are familiar with (though the stream maybe targeted to newer players instead of forum and &gt;G vets, which would alter that assumption quite a lot).</p>\n<p>It would be very cool to have it be a character that wasn't announced previously, but I'd be pretty surprised by that.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I think the highest likelyhood is one of the Spite clones. Hypocalypse or Mangrove would be in my next teir down.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>My long shot hope is for it to be <a href=\"https://twitter.com/GtGAdam/status/565946433451622400\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a> mystery character though!</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:16:52.602Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
