      "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nIs it one that is announced already? &nbsp;That&#39;s what I expect it to be.\n\n[/quote]\n\nLikey it is one of the new characters to Tactics if they plan on spending time going through the concept and all of that. They wouldn&#39;t need to touch too much on the concept of a character we already are familiar with (though the stream maybe targeted to newer players instead of forum and &gt;G vets, which would alter that assumption quite a lot).\n\nIt would be very cool to have it be a character that wasn&#39;t announced previously, but I&#39;d be pretty surprised by that.&nbsp;\n\nI think the highest likelyhood is one of the Spite clones. Hypocalypse or Mangrove would be in my next teir down.&nbsp;\n\nMy long shot hope is for it to be <a href=\"https://twitter.com/GtGAdam/status/565946433451622400\">this</a> mystery character though!\n",
